      "raw_text": "🚧 𝐓𝐫𝐚𝐟𝐟𝐢𝐜 𝐀𝐝𝐯𝐢𝐬𝐨𝐫𝐲 🚧\nMiami-Dade Water and Sewer crews will be conducting site testing near 401 Biscayne Blvd. starting at 9 p.m. on Tuesday, Feb. 10.\n\nTo accommodate this work, one lane on NE 4th Street, the north side exit of Bayside Marketplace, will be closed.\n\nWork is expected to be completed within six hours. @miamidadewater",
